{
  "name": "Arcane Initiate",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain Proficiency in the Arcana skill, and you gain two cantrips of your choice from the wizard spell list. For you, these cantrips count as cleric cantrips.</p><p>Additionally, whenever you gain access to a new spell level of your domain spells, including at this level, you can exchange one domain spell from that spell level for another spell from the wizard spell list.</p>",
